			<item>
				<title>Descargas</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/es/downloads/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/es/downloads/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;descargas&#34;&gt;descargas&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;download-item flex items-center gap-4 mb-8&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;http://douglaslab.org/gelbox/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34; aria-label=&#34;Descargar Gelbox&#34; class=&#34;w-16 h-16 shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/icons/download_a_cube.png&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; class=&#34;max-w-full max-h-full object-contain&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 class=&#34;mt-4 leading-tight&#34;&gt;Gelbox&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;prose-sm&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Simulador de electroforesis en gel (aplicación para macOS).&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;download-item flex items-center gap-4 mb-8&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://sdouglas.github.io/lr-notebook/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34; aria-label=&#34;Ver lr-notebook&#34; class=&#34;w-16 h-16 shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/icons/download_g_cube.png&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; class=&#34;max-w-full max-h-full object-contain&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 class=&#34;mt-4 leading-tight&#34;&gt;lr-notebook&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;prose-sm&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Cuaderno electrónico basado en Lektor: &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/douglaslab/lr-notebook&#34;&gt;lr-notebook&lt;/a&gt;. El código fuente está disponible bajo la licencia BSD-3. Aquí hay un &lt;a href=&#34;https://sdouglas.github.io/lr-notebook/&#34;&gt;ejemplo en vivo&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;download-item flex items-center gap-4 mb-8&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://douglaslab.github.io/grantmerge/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34; aria-label=&#34;Ver GrantMerge&#34; class=&#34;w-16 h-16 shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/icons/download_t_cube.png&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; class=&#34;max-w-full max-h-full object-contain&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 class=&#34;mt-4 leading-tight&#34;&gt;GrantMerge&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;prose-sm&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Una &lt;a href=&#34;https://douglaslab.github.io/grantmerge/&#34;&gt;herramienta&lt;/a&gt; para combinar rápidamente hojas de cálculo con plantillas de documentos.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Douglas Lab | Research</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/es/es/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/es/es/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;what-are-we-doing-in-spanish&#34;&gt;What are we doing? IN SPANISH?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We aim to use the building blocks of life to create novel tools and devices to perform useful tasks on the nanoscale. A short introduction to our research can be found &lt;a href=&#34;http://youtu.be/ITtGJUGXFKc&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;how-do-we-do-it&#34;&gt;How do we do it?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We build with biomolecules, especially DNA and proteins, so most of our work is focused on molecular design and related method development. We also write a lot of software to support these efforts.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
